  "basis": [
    "All ZIP filenames and payloads inspected; no path traversal, private key or provider token formats found.",
    "HH3 inspected container/image environment contains only test/source/runtime configuration; no provider credentials. Only evidence bind mount. Child logs contain two generic seeded role-account addresses; no passwords or personal recipient address.",
